# Guides held back from publication. One slug per line; "#" starts a comment.
#
# Selection is automatic: tools/port_guides.py mirrors every guide directory
# on the upstream repo's MAIN branch (read via git, regardless of which branch
# is checked out over there) into research-guides/, and tools/build.py then
# publishes research-guides/ -> temp/. This file is the only hand-maintained
# piece: it lists guides that are on main but must NOT publish. Every entry
# must be a real directory on main, or port_guides.py fails loudly.
#
# Normally the only entry is the authoring template. To hold a finished guide
# back temporarily, add its slug here; remove it to publish.

research-guide-quarto-template   # authoring template, not a publishable guide
